 "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rXLiQ8YRgaYQ7kNvwGk2XPR&_nc_oc=AdkMu4Gad3KJkYV3mKouHHZHXX1RgSqjjGNf0J1o_6U_jLpR5kJEDspfGARFF4FA3LY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzyGysDwz93Y-OX-spNuA0_N3jdgUGDH-2YjgAakHx_yw&oe=69BFCDB9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zaXseRjiaFkQ7kNvwF-xMek&_nc_oc=AdkWU9zrQUntswnyCn9sHbo72tj9GNSCle8M4kANBIBVI7n2KrZ1mxNAW5CYRtvqHWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfztdhslzKJnn0xAj4Yv-5t3oXq-YqpF6TXRSEWK-4YzCw&oe=69BFDD53"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jq3wDZuGbY0Q7kNvwEpKHkr&_nc_oc=AdmAVb_cS6my-H8ovpNzN5hhbkb0ASjnirE-3kJrx6aKMnhLkws9wjPpz4S98bSFHwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz8hztBRvdTGKYiqRv1wm7nfRtUNCh2k9V6TAzfv8rvwA&oe=69BFE8FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=03kAEKedUDEQ7kNvwHkm-kk&_nc_oc=AdmbPj2CRhlsLKki8Mhn63XWaSWKIMf75EgpOPD5VsWMwnPsl7k8rM8IMLKIRLXMDLk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyzUuAKvzUnFNV4R40S81J-eWJe2PcjReKwCkvn9g7GUQ&oe=69BFEA4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_b0YsJCm2eEQ7kNvwHDFIfn&_nc_oc=AdmtKbdhtPRC-7hJAgw-IWs4No6S4z4nUA_Zu0GuPJoC_Qtz_hNdI2mJIbrE1ylmK8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx1g91wZcj640jvel0keZKDGeuDxWlMtj6n2R6n4wx7Cg&oe=69BFD37E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aerodrums", "supp